Description-Content-Type: text/markdown

# SmartEV2GFleetChargingSystem
Our research question is: Can a model-free RL agent optimize V2G fleet scheduling under partial observability, implicitly managing the risk of unannounced early departures, and what economic or grid-performance trade-offs emerge from this robust policy?
